  "content": "<p>通过此模组，您将获得七种攻城器械：迫击炮、投石车、弩炮、攻城槌、抛石机、长管炮和攻城梯。每台器械都配有逼真的音效与动画，完美还原中世纪战场的沉浸氛围。</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">使用说明<br></span>按\"I\"键打开器械物品栏，按\"F\"键操作器械，手持弹药物品对器械右键点击即可装填。</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">兼容性说明<br></span><strong>村民招募模组</strong>：查看使招募士兵能操作攻城器械的兼容项目：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits-medieval-siege-machine-mod-compat-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民招募-中世纪攻城器械模组兼容扩展</a></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">加入Discord社区</span></h3><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jLgF2Sp/discord-new-2021-logo-45-D326-F28-C-seeklogo-com.jpg\" alt=\"Discord按钮\"></a></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">安装指南</span></h3><h1>请确保已安装最新版<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>，若使用1.21.1版本还需安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></h1><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">游戏截图</span></h3><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Vv6P9Vy/2022-03-04-21-08-02.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Kh5wC4C/battering-ram.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qpQ0dgs/2022-03-04-21-08-35.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cJH2nm2/icon.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5MQH3fW/logo.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vQ886Xz/culverin.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/N9J2Kgg/2023-09-21-13-45-26.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">合成配方</span></h3><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZcFNbVr/siege-workbench.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"966\"></span></strong></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">制作鸣谢</span></h3><ul>\n<li>Lexiolty - 攻城器械模型与材质制作</li>\n<li>Goodbird - 1.20.1版本移植</li>\n<li>Haiaiel - 1.21.1 Fabric版本移植</li>\n</ul>",
